note sites: found by a one-token change of a tracked program; reaches the omc error site in hostval (code 9)
note VFIO-less negative for host and QEMU user-mode: stdin is not an acquired VFIO device descriptor.
global data uchar 16
fn main to int
put data 0 uchar 16
r = vfioirq 256 0 uint 15213 data 0 16
ret int r
end
